From d29bae93129455a55a965afeefc2f6fbab1ce9c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wangjianxin <wangjianxin@canaan-creative.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Apr 2026 16:59:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] uvc: Add VPU-encoded video source support

- Add new VIDEO_SOURCE_VPU_ENCODED type for VPU-encoded streams
- Implement vpu-source.c with VPU encoder initialization and frame capture
- Add vpu-source.h header for VPU source API
- Update events.c loop timing for better responsiveness
- Integrate VPU source into main.c with camera device support

This adds hardware-accelerated video encoding support using the VPU,
allowing UVC gadget to stream encoded video from camera devices.
